00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:52.000
Carmen Cruickshank: That's a good question. Impressions is just the amount of times your ad showed up, even if someone sees it or not. Let's say, I don't think this is the case, but someone's ad could show up on the bottom of the page and they would count that as an impression even if someone doesn't see it. But most of the time it's like your ad just pops up and then clicks is like someone actually clicks on it.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:49.000
